      "text": "Lens → 45° mirror → Pentaprism/Pentamirror → Eye"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-CAMERA-TECHNOLOGY.md#010",
      "path": [
        "05-CAMERA-TECHNOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
