        "section": "photography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Camera Technology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MIRROR PROBLEMS:\n  Mirror blackout during exposure: can't see through OVF during exposure\n  Mirror slap: vibration from mirror flip → camera shake → reduces sharpness\n               especially at 1/15s–1/125s range\n  Mirror box depth: requires large back-focal distance → retrofocus wide angles\n  Mass and complexity: mirror + pentaprism + focus screen + mirror drive mechanism\n```"
    },
